		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">23</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">1. To find out sum of squares of first n natural numbers, we figured out the following logic.
    a. We will use the formula n*(n+1)*(2*n+1)/6
2. To read input, we use readLine(). But it will always give a string. 
3. But string operations are different from arithmetic operations (e.g. 5+5 will give 10, but "5"+"5" will give "55")
So, how can we do the calculations?
Luckily, Javascript has a way to convert string to integer.</attribute>
